@model Position
@{ ViewData["Title"] = (Model?.Id ?? 0) == 0 ? "Thêm chức vụ" : "Sửa chức vụ"; var isEdit = (Model?.Id ?? 0) != 0; }
<div class="page-header"><h1><i class="fas fa-user-tag"></i> @ViewData["Title"]</h1></div>
<div class="card" style="max-width:600px"><div class="card-body">
<form asp-action="@(isEdit?"Edit":"Create")" method="post">
    @if(isEdit){<input type="hidden" asp-for="Id" />}
    <div class="form-group mb-3"><label asp-for="TenChucVu"></label><input asp-for="TenChucVu" class="form-control" /><span asp-validation-for="TenChucVu" class="text-danger"></span></div>
    <div class="form-group mb-3"><label asp-for="MoTa"></label><textarea asp-for="MoTa" class="form-control" rows="3"></textarea></div>
    <div class="row mb-3"><div class="col"><label asp-for="CapBac"></label><input asp-for="CapBac" type="number" min="1" max="10" class="form-control" /></div>
    <div class="col"><label asp-for="MucLuongCoSo"></label><input asp-for="MucLuongCoSo" type="number" class="form-control" /></div></div>
    <div class="d-flex gap-2"><button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary"><i class="fas fa-save me-1"></i>Lưu</button><a asp-action="Index" class="btn btn-secondary">Hủy</a></div>
</form></div></div>

@section Scripts { @{await Html.RenderPartialAsync("_ValidationScriptsPartial");} }
